  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dal makhani serves 4 and takes about 100 minutes. The long, slow simmer is what makes it silky, so do not rush it. Stir often near the end so it does not catch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The more you stir as it reduces, the creamier the lentils become."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
